  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "\u0110inh \u0110i\u1EC1n"
    Lines:
    - "Ti\u1EBFng h\xF2 reo c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Hoa L\u01B0 vang r\u1EC1n nh\u01B0 s\u1EA5m,
      \xE1t c\u1EA3 ti\u1EBFng k\xEAu kh\xF3c c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Ng\xF4 \u0111ang v\u1EE1
      tr\u1EADn. C\u1EDD lau ph\u1EA5p ph\u1EDBi tr\xEAn th\xE0nh, b\xE1o hi\u1EC7u
      m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng l\u1EABy l\u1EEBng \u2013 minh ch\u1EE9ng cho
      m\u01B0u tr\xED v\xE0 uy l\u1EF1c c\u1EE7a B\u1ED9 L\u0129nh. N\xFAi r\u1EEBng
      Hoa L\u01B0 ch\u1EA5n \u0111\u1ED9ng, l\xF2ng qu\xE2n c\xE0ng th\xEAm tin ph\u1EE5c."
    - "Nh\u01B0ng sau \xE1nh h\xE0o quang \u1EA5y, chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\u1EE7
      k\xEDn m\xF9i m\xE1u v\xE0 kh\xF3i l\u1EEDa. H\xE0ng tr\u0103m x\xE1c qu\xE2n
      Ng\xF4 ch\u1EA5t th\xE0nh g\xF2, xen l\u1EABn c\u1EA3 th\xE2n th\u1EC3 binh
      s\u0129 Hoa L\u01B0 ng\xE3 xu\u1ED1ng. Ti\u1EBFng g\u01B0\u01A1m gi\xE1o r\u01A1i
      l\u1EA3 t\u1EA3, ti\u1EBFng ng\u1EF1a h\u1EA5p h\u1ED1i vang v\u1ECDng. M\u1ED9t
      chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng l\u1EDBn, song c\u0169ng l\xE0 m\u1ED9t v\u1EBFt th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      s\xE2u ho\u1EAFm trong l\xF2ng qu\xE2n d\xE2n \u2013 nh\u1EAFc nh\u1EDF r\u1EB1ng
      con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EF1ng nghi\u1EC7p kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 tr\u1EA3i
      b\u1EB1ng kh\u1EA3i ho\xE0n ca, m\xE0 c\xF2n ch\u1EA5t ch\u1ED3ng b\u1EB1ng
      x\u01B0\u01A1ng m\xE1u \u0111\u1ED3ng b\xE0o."
